      "id": "system-handover-yang-benar-benar-lengkap",
      "number": "01",
      "title": "System Handover yang benar-benar lengkap.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Master Blueprint · Widhy × Colin · September 2026"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Bukan cuma source code. Target akhirnya adalah supaya setiap aplikasi, website, CMS, API, database, hosting, domain, monitoring, integration, deployment, recovery dan ownership dapat ditemukan, dipahami dan dijalankan oleh Internal IT."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Approach: kita tidak menunggu Colin membuat satu dokumen besar. Kita buat struktur dokumentasinya sendiri, kemudian minta informasi satu per satu, isi evidence-nya, lakukan reverse handover, dan tandai capability sebagai transferred hanya setelah kita bisa menjalankannya sendiri."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Target Deliverables"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "One technical map for the Sensatia ecosystem."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "10 documentation domains 16 structured KT sessions 5 readiness gates 0 plaintext secrets in docs"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "KNOWN NEED VERIFY ASK COLIN DOCUMENT OUTPUT"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scope",
      "number": "02",
      "title": "Yang dipindahkan adalah operating knowledge, bukan sekadar file.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "01 · Handover Scope"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Dokumentasi harus bisa menjawab: apa yang ada , bagaimana sistem bekerja , di mana sistem hidup , siapa owner-nya , dan bagaimana recover saat rusak ."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "System Landscape"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Semua aplikasi, service, website, repo, database, integration, dan domain harus punya relationship map."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Build & Change"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Repo, branch, environment, testing, deployment, migration, release, dan rollback."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Operate & Recover"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Logs, monitoring, alerts, backup, restore, data recovery, dan incident runbook."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Ownership & Access"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Admin owner, billing owner, access, MFA, credential recovery, dan secret rotation."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Security Rule: jangan pernah menaruh password, API key, token, private key, database password, MFA recovery code, atau secret aktual di Jira, Confluence, Slack, atau dokumen ini. Yang didokumentasikan hanya: secret name, purpose, owner, approved secret-store location, rotation procedure, dan recovery path."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "landscape",
      "number": "03",
      "title": "Kita mulai dari peta besar dulu.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "02 · System Landscape"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Detail bisa kita isi bertahap. Yang penting semua sistem, owner, repo, hosting, database, dan dependency masuk dalam satu registry."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "StockWizz Internal business system untuk inventory, warehouse/DC, retail, purchasing, order, product, dan operational workflow. KNOWN"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "sensatia.com Customer-facing website / e-commerce dengan locale seperti /id , /en , dan kemungkinan locale lainnya. KNOWN"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Website CMS Lokasi exact belum boleh diasumsikan. Harus dikonfirmasi apakah CMS berada di StockWizz, website repo, atau service terpisah. ASK COLIN"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "StockWizz API Backend/API untuk UI dan external integrations. Route map, runtime, service boundaries dan side-effect endpoint perlu didokumentasikan. VERIFY"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Database MongoDB disebut dalam dokumentasi saat ini. Production/sandbox topology, database names, index, backup, restore dan sensitive collections perlu diverifikasi. VERIFY CURRENT"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Jubelio Integrasi stock update, SKU mapping, location mapping, retry, recovery dan reconciliation. KNOWN"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Payment Stripe muncul pada incident website. Semua provider lain dan current usage perlu diverifikasi. VERIFY LIST"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Better Stack Logging / observability sudah digunakan. Sources, retention, useful queries, alerts dan billing owner perlu masuk dokumentasi. IN USE"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Sentry Belum boleh dianggap digunakan. Minta Colin confirm: digunakan atau tidak. CONFIRM / N/A"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Hosting / Domain Hosting provider, compute resources, registrar, DNS, SSL, CDN, storage, billing dan admin ownership harus dipetakan. ASK COLIN"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "documentation",
      "number": "04",
      "title": "Struktur dokumentasi yang perlu kita bangun.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "03 · Documentation Blueprint"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Confluence menjadi global technical memory. Repository menyimpan implementation-level documentation. Jira tetap fokus ke pekerjaan."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "00 START HERE IT Systems — Start Here Master index seluruh systems dan documentation. System Portfolio & Ownership Purpose, owner, backup, criticality, support route. Handover Readiness Dashboard Explained → Documented → Access → Practiced → Verified. Current Work Register Feature, bug, PR, branch, SB/prod status, blocker."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "01 STOCKWIZZ StockWizz — System Overview Purpose, users, critical modules, boundaries. StockWizz — Architecture Map Frontend → API → DB → jobs → integrations. Repository & Code Map Repos, branches, entry points, active vs legacy folders. Module Catalog Inventory, DC, retail, PO, orders, products, CMS if applicable. API Catalog Routes, callers, auth, mutation, side effects. Database & Data Model Collections, relations, indexes, source-of-truth. Jobs / Cron / Worker Trigger, schedule, retry, logs, failure behavior. Business Logic & Legacy Rules dan history yang tidak obvious dari code."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "02 WEBSITE & CMS sensatia.com — Architecture Repo, framework, runtime, hosting, API dependencies. CMS & Content Flow CMS location, translation, content model, media, publish. Locale / Routing /id, /en, slug mapping, redirect, fallback, canonical. Commerce Flow Product → cart → checkout → payment → order → fulfilment. Payment Integration Provider, webhook, retry, idempotency, order states. Website Release & Rollback SB/staging/prod, cache purge, verification."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "03 INFRASTRUCTURE Infrastructure Inventory Compute, DB, cache, storage, network, CDN. Environment Map Local, SB, staging?, production. Hosting Topology Resource, region, process, dependencies, billing owner. Domain / DNS / SSL Registry Registrar, records, renewal, CDN, owner. Backup & Restore Schedule, retention, encryption, restore test. Disaster Recovery Failure scenarios, RTO, RPO, recovery order."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "04 OBSERVABILITY Better Stack Guide Sources, logs, queries, correlation, retention. Sentry Guide / N/A Projects, releases, source maps, alerts—if used. Prometheus / Metrics Exporter, scrape, live metrics, dashboards. Alert Matrix Alert → severity → owner → first check → escalation."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "05 INTEGRATIONS Integration Registry Data direction, auth, retry, failure, fallback. Jubelio SKU/location mapping, stock sync, retry, reconciliation. Payment Providers Stripe + verify provider lainnya. Marketplace Integrations Shopee, TikTok, Tokopedia, Jubelio boundaries. Authentication Provider Tenant, apps, roles, callbacks, ownership. Email / Notifications Provider, sender, templates, trigger, retry."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "06 SECURITY & ACCESS Access Matrix Have / Limited / Missing / N/A per service. Credential Ownership Registry Secret name, owner, vault, rotation, recovery. Admin / Billing Ownership Organization owner, subscription, invoice, renewal. Access Recovery / Offboarding Revoke, transfer, lost account, emergency access."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "07 DEVELOPMENT & RELEASE Development Workflow Branch, PR, review, test, release, hotfix. Deployment Runbook Exact steps, checks, owner, evidence. Rollback Runbook App rollback, DB considerations, last-known-good. Release History Date, change, PR, environment, validation."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "08 INCIDENTS Incident Response Guide Severity, triage, logs, safe action, escalation. Stock Integrity Runbook Mismatch, duplicate deduction, wrong IN/OUT. Website Checkout Runbook Payment/order/cart/retry issues. Jubelio Sync Runbook Failed SKU, retry, partial sync, manual fallback. Performance Runbook Browser → API → DB → logs → indexes. Post-Incident Notes Facts, root cause, action, prevention, docs update."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "09 DECISIONS & LEGACY Architecture Decision Records Why, alternatives, trade-off, current validity. Legacy Map Active / Legacy but Used / Deprecated / Unknown. Technical Debt Register Impact, risk, workaround, recommendation. Business Workflow Maps Inventory, production, warehouse, retail, e-commerce."
        }
      ]
    },
